    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/af9c4e7c78daee0a383ca80c5e867f25.webp?t=1745751915\" width=500 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to enter, fun to master controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/df0903678eae8082005618b1ee2f5cc3.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/df0903678eae8082005618b1ee2f5cc3.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/df0903678eae8082005618b1ee2f5cc3.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/9b0e98aaa28e53b7c98c40c10eb1f96d.webp?t=1745751915\" width=500 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add style to every game! Customize everything from appearance to accessories, and create your favorite plushie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b7e454eb6e7dc0844c25cab212587633.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b7e454eb6e7dc0844c25cab212587633.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b7e454eb6e7dc0844c25cab212587633.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ed452510e7138c133e70dfc0d1b8d0e4.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ed452510e7138c133e70dfc0d1b8d0e4.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ed452510e7138c133e70dfc0d1b8d0e4.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/aae3d123db6bdc53ec74b38cedb7ace0.webp?t=1745751915\" width=500 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Plush Party, there's never a dull moment. When the claw catches you, become one yourself and chase down your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b44da8c1ef04ed3fbb533db58421aac5.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b44da8c1ef04ed3fbb533db58421aac5.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b44da8c1ef04ed3fbb533db58421aac5.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature list: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accesible controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage diversity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along with up to 8 friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Less than a minute rounds.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/af9c4e7c78daee0a383ca80c5e867f25.webp?t=1745751915\" width=500 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to enter, fun to master controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/df0903678eae8082005618b1ee2f5cc3.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/df0903678eae8082005618b1ee2f5cc3.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/df0903678eae8082005618b1ee2f5cc3.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/9b0e98aaa28e53b7c98c40c10eb1f96d.webp?t=1745751915\" width=500 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add style to every game! Customize everything from appearance to accessories, and create your favorite plushie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b7e454eb6e7dc0844c25cab212587633.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b7e454eb6e7dc0844c25cab212587633.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b7e454eb6e7dc0844c25cab212587633.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ed452510e7138c133e70dfc0d1b8d0e4.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ed452510e7138c133e70dfc0d1b8d0e4.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/ed452510e7138c133e70dfc0d1b8d0e4.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/aae3d123db6bdc53ec74b38cedb7ace0.webp?t=1745751915\" width=500 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Plush Party, there's never a dull moment. When the claw catches you, become one yourself and chase down your rivals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b44da8c1ef04ed3fbb533db58421aac5.poster.avif?t=1745751915\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b44da8c1ef04ed3fbb533db58421aac5.webm?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266120/extras/b44da8c1ef04ed3fbb533db58421aac5.mp4?t=1745751915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature list: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accesible controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage diversity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along with up to 8 friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Less than a minute rounds.</p></li></ul>",
